---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import CtaBlock from '../components/CtaBlock.astro';
import { clinic, addressLine } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | Newport Homeopathy Clinic" description="How Newport Homeopathy Clinic collects, uses and protects your personal information." breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Privacy policy', href: '/privacy-policy/' }]}>
  <section>
    <div class="container prose">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p><em>Draft for the clinic to review. TODO(open item 16): confirm the data controller, ICO registration number and processors before launch.</em></p>
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>{clinic.name}, {addressLine} is the data controller for personal information collected through this website. Contact: <a href={`mailto:${clinic.email}`}>{clinic.email}</a>.</p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you send an enquiry we collect your name, email address, phone number, your preferred consultation type, format, date and time, and any message you choose to send. Please don't include medical details in the form.</p>
      <h2>Why we use it and our lawful basis</h2>
      <p>We use these details only to reply to your enquiry and arrange your appointment. Our lawful basis is your consent and, once you book, steps taken at your request before entering into a contract.</p>
      <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
      <p>Our email delivery provider and (once in use) our online booking provider process data on our behalf under contract. We never sell your data and do not use advertising pixels.</p>
      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>With your consent we use Google Analytics to count visits and clicks on buttons such as "Call" or "Book". We never send your name, email, phone number or message to analytics. See our <a href="/cookie-policy/">cookie policy</a>.</p>
      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>Enquiries are deleted after 12 months unless you become a client, in which case records are kept in line with professional guidance.</p>
      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>You can ask to see, correct or delete your information, or withdraw consent, by emailing us. If you're unhappy with how we handle your data you can complain to the Information Commissioner's Office at <a href="https://ico.org.uk/make-a-complaint/" rel="noopener">ico.org.uk</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <CtaBlock />
</Base>
